  contraband: []
  boothLines:
  - Afternoon. Sergeant Ortega. Well. Was. Two tours, Iraq. Fallujah, 2004. You were
    in diapers, probably.
  - My daughter's getting married Saturday. El Paso. She asked me to walk her down
    the aisle. She's asked every year since she was six.
  lineIfApproved: Thank you, son. Hooah.
  lineIfRejected: ...Copy that. It's my brother's. Worth a shot. She said she'd do
    a video call. That's nice of her. That's real nice.
  lineIfImprisoned: Twenty years, they'll give me. For walking my daughter down an
    aisle. ...Put in the report that I didn't fight you.
